{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULL Train</strong> is a 2D pixel-art roguelike where you fight, adapt, and survive your way through an endless, procedurally-generated sci-fi train. Each train car is a new level \u2014 some filled with enemies, some with hazards, or strange physics like zero gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through, collect items to unlock permanent upgrades, and try to push further with each run. When you die, it\u2019s back to the start \u2014 but with better gear, sharper reflexes, and a new strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling combat with melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks, energy swords, and futuristic gear to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized train cars: enemies, multi-floor layouts, gravity shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression system: earn &quot;ticket stubs&quot; to unlock skills, weapons, and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty sci-fi pixel art style with atmospheric lighting and cinematic vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for replayability, learning, and experimentation \u2014 every run is different</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Currently available in English.</i><br>Localization into additional languages may come in a future update. Let us know which languages you'd like to see via the community hub!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717840?t=1759097605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717840?t=1759097605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717840/e72b6f07605880bbcf214859e6d1ed44d1c573bc/ca